<title>CROATIA: Croatian August currency reserves rise to $4.4 bln.</title>
<headline>Croatian August currency reserves rise to $4.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA CURRENCY RESERVES     AUGUST	 JULY	AUG '95</p>
<p> Total (million USD)	    4,428.3     4,239.4     2,883.6</p>
<p> National Bank of Croatia     2,333.1     2,216.3     1,863.1</p>
<p> Commercial banks		 2,095.2     2,023.1     1,020.5</p>
<p>NOTE -- Central bank's reserves rose 5.3 percent in August from July and commercial banks' 3.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
